<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#IdentifiedResource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Being an identified resource does not imply that MODAVIS has allocated an MDVS identifier. Exchange profiles may use repository IRIs or UUID URNs; the MODAVIS publication profile applies the narrower managed-resource rules."@en .
