<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#canonicalLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The exchange SHACL profile enforces rdf:langString because rdf:langString is outside the OWL 2 RL datatype map."@en .
