<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#hasName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an identified resource to a reified name that can carry language, type, provenance, and validity information."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#hasName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "No global domain is asserted so externally defined identified resources can use the naming pattern without being inferred into a narrower MODAVIS class."@en .
