<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#locatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an entity to a place at which it is located in the described context."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#locatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Location may be time- or context-dependent. Qualify it with an assertion, context binding, state, or event when an unscoped direct triple would overstate the claim."@en .
