<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#mdvsIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An optional legacy MODAVIS v1 identifier string retained for compatibility with existing Release 1.3 data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#mdvsIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "MDVS v1 is not a persistent-identifier standard: its historical check character is ineffective, the payload has limited entropy, and no public global allocation ledger exists. Do not mint new independent identifiers with this property; see the MDVS v1 compatibility note."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#nameValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
